{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The path to a demon\u2019s heart is through its stomach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arcane Eats, the best deck-building mechanics get spiced up by cooking elements to add a new depth of flavor and strategy! Every turn is a strategic puzzle as you balance your energy and ingredient cook times, and try to keep your cool in the face of customer whims and whining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192\u00a0 Play ingredient cards onto enchanted cooktops<br>\u2192\u00a0 modify them with a kitchen of magical tools,<br>\u2192\u00a0 then serve your meals to the hungry hordes \u2013 and get paid!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improvise fantastical meals like a master chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own cuisine deck from hundreds of mythic ingredients, magical kitchen tools, and culinary spells. Then invite your customers to sit at the chef\u2019s table as you cook up an adventurous meal full of juicy combos with the cards you have at hand. Flame broil some Red Dragon Ribs, forge golden delights in the Dwarven Deep Fryer, and draw a salt circle to perform the Happy Hour Ritual. No recipes required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a08d4ee9e56fe219d27efd482d0c4d94.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a08d4ee9e56fe219d27efd482d0c4d94.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a08d4ee9e56fe219d27efd482d0c4d94.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a restaurant run and earn your fame\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a restaurant is hard \u2013 you\u2019ll have to satisfy hangry customers, balance the books, and keep the health &amp; purity inspector at bay. Improve your menu by shopping in town and recruit a crew of waitstaff and sous chefs to optimize your kitchen. If you can impress legendary chefs like Guy Fairy, Wolfman Puck, and the formidable Gorgon Ramsey, you may finally achieve a coveted 3 Mythril Star rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/b0d32665af2c8f7a1ff3ac4651655114.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/b0d32665af2c8f7a1ff3ac4651655114.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/b0d32665af2c8f7a1ff3ac4651655114.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the ranks of the three heroic cooking guilds\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each guild has their own unique cards and style of play. Fire up hearty meals with the Hearth, weave elemental spices with the Grove, and master mise-en-place with the Order \u2013 but watch out, you may find yourself tempted to open the forbidden Gastronomicon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/53be3950724e7dca6a6da5952c4807d0.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/53be3950724e7dca6a6da5952c4807d0.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/53be3950724e7dca6a6da5952c4807d0.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Savor the endless flavor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s endless replayability with hundreds of cards, staff, upgrades, and unexpected phone calls making each restaurant run unique. Along the way, you\u2019ll get to know the flavorful regulars. If you can learn how to satisfy each one\u2019s special tastes, you\u2019ll unlock new possibilities in town. And as your restaurant successes grow, you can ring the ancient Dinner Bell to add new challenges \u2013 but expect to draw the attention of The Hunger\u2026 Never forget, the path to a demon's heart is through their stomach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2640090?t=1770276827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/b465ef9344756869b91e404ee0c754b7f7cfc57f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770276827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/b4d59fcc306cb8c4e5c120fbe572431cd40c4ac8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770276827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/b4d59fcc306cb8c4e5c120fbe572431cd40c4ac8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770276827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3528960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/eb71f4f24cbeba2afba9239db9ae1674.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The path to a demon\u2019s heart is through its stomach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arcane Eats, the best deck-building mechanics get spiced up by cooking elements to add a new depth of flavor and strategy! Every turn is a strategic puzzle as you balance your energy and ingredient cook times, and try to keep your cool in the face of customer whims and whining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192\u00a0 Play ingredient cards onto enchanted cooktops<br>\u2192\u00a0 modify them with a kitchen of magical tools,<br>\u2192\u00a0 then serve your meals to the hungry hordes \u2013 and get paid!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.webm?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a0e2268d6bf9ad087acce0c06b790b98.mp4?t=1770276827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improvise fantastical meals like a master chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own cuisine deck from hundreds of mythic ingredients, magical kitchen tools, and culinary spells. Then invite your customers to sit at the chef\u2019s table as you cook up an adventurous meal full of juicy combos with the cards you have at hand. Flame broil some Red Dragon Ribs, forge golden delights in the Dwarven Deep Fryer, and draw a salt circle to perform the Happy Hour Ritual. No recipes required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extras/a08d4ee9e56fe219d27efd482d0c4d94.poster.avif?t=1770276827\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640090/extr